  (text "Target: 24.0 V, 30 W continuous, 300 kHz. RFB 580k/20k gives 24.0 V nominal." (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 202542f1-90dc-4b7b-830a-8b271110dbc1))
  (text "At 8 V/30 W/85%, Iavg=4.41 A. With 15 uH, ripple is about 1.19 App and peak about 5.00 A." (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0068121a-f891-4460-b588-ad6cf4d8798d))
  (text "20 mΩ shunt gives about 6 A boost peak limit. 15 uH replaces the provisional 6.8 uH PRD anchor." (at 20 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b01cccad-d223-44a9-8226-2686f6b235ff))
